    <p style="margin:42px 0 0;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid rgba(24,24,24,.2);color:rgba(24,24,24,.58);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;">
        This article is for general information and is not medical advice. Patch test new skincare products, and check with a doctor first if you are pregnant, breastfeeding or using prescription treatments. Persistent, painful or very irritated skin should be assessed by a qualified dermatologist.
    </p>
